cordis-rs
=========

This repository is a Rust implementation of Cordis, the meta-framework at the
core of Koishi: https://github.com/cordiverse/cordis

It ports Cordis's semantics and public JavaScript API as of cordis@4.0.0-rc.8
(tag v4.0.0-rc.8, commit f46ae95), and its test suite.

Cordis is MIT licensed:

    Copyright (c) 2021-present Shigma

The following material is Cordis's own, carried here under its MIT license:

  - conformance/upstream/*.mjs — packages/core/tests/*.ts of cordis@4.0.0-rc.8,
    with TypeScript types stripped by tools/port-specs.cjs (and one decorator
    applied by hand, since Boa has no decorator syntax).
  - conformance/node_modules/cordis — the published cordis@4.0.0-rc.8
    lib/index.js, byte for byte, the reference the differential tests run
    against. Its LICENSE file is beside it.
  - conformance/node_modules/cosmokit and conformance/node_modules/schemastery —
    the builds Rebon vendors, with their LICENSE files beside them
    (cosmokit and schemastery are also Shigma's, MIT).

The JavaScript face of the native core (crates/cordis-verve/js/) reproduces the
object model of Cordis's `Context`, `Service`, traceable proxies and `Logger`,
following Cordis's sources, and is likewise derived from Cordis under MIT.
